notes.content:
Hi detectives,

Our game’s launch was almost a week ago and it’s been a hell of a journey so far: a huge thanks from the middle of the Atlantic and an ocean-sized hug to all of you who have been supporting us.

Since launch, we’ve been keeping a watchful eye and taking notes regarding any feedback we’ve been receiving from our players, especially to reports of bugs and gameplay-related issues.

[img]https://media.giphy.com/media/HPFmxtE3ioa2535NyZ/giphy.gif[/img]

So below, you can see some of the [b]contents of this new patch:[/b]

[h2]Balance Patches:[/h2]

[list]
[*] Removed the out of stamina walk speed penalty;
[*] John Souza’s walk speed has been increased;
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes:[/h2]

[list]
[*] Fixed a bug where the game wouldn't detect the controller the first time you played the game;
[*] Fixed a bug where sometimes you could win or lose multiple times at once by repeatedly pressing the “Stand” button at blackjack;
[*] Fixed a bug where sometimes you would lose some perk points;
[*] Fixed a bug where you could get stuck on the third stage of Rourke if you dashed into the planks at the right time;
[*] Fixed a bug where Amuso’s zodiac puzzle would break if the player managed to activate 4 of the symbols fast enough;
[*] Fixed a bug where you couldn't take screenshots in the game with Steam Overlay;
[*] Fixed a bug where you could crash the game if you changed from mouse to controller and then went to the map;
[*] Fixed a bug where you could crash the game if you "talked" with the fridge in the right circumstances;
[/list]

 Thanks again for your patience and for all your feedback,

[b]Cereal Games[/b]
